Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13. Completion Criteria", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"037ab097-5cda-624c-9934-aa035d92321f"],

Cell["\<\
A rigorous completion of this structure requires all of the following to be \
true:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"74503285-31e1-b74d-af63-b04ab5dde7cd"],

Cell["\<\
1. The Euler\[Dash]Lagrange equation derives symbolically from the OPF action.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"24ec6907-b3b9-cb40-8e40-bdf914afad38"],

Cell["2. The boundary-value problem solves at high precision.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3a6a09c5-cb8d-cc45-ba15-866e4fb87ad1"],

Cell["\<\
3. Boundary conditions are satisfied to the requested tolerance.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fc3b5e05-1663-4a40-aa4d-53c7af0a3a0a"],

Cell["4. The residual is uniformly small.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9c1e8d29-5502-0547-9e3b-f92a426533f6"],

Cell["5. The solution is stable under precision refinement.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1c6d96ce-5ecb-ef49-aca9-2135097b8c79"],

Cell["6. The linearized operator has a stable spectrum.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f412f637-7a8d-d240-9785-f6930f4d1173"],

Cell["\<\
7. Layer 2 measurement observables are numerically well-defined.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0d76af44-eaec-b849-937e-73a4cc1e1495"],

Cell["8. The automated test report passes.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9141a0a1-c4bf-7d4d-b954-de9fa1a58c57"],

Cell["9. Visual diagnostics show no pathology.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8a158f11-d801-3f4a-924c-fef6e1cf221b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "If any test fails, the structure is ",
 StyleBox["not complete",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " and the failing section identifies what must be repaired. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"15e5702e-79c3-c242-89be-9c13f7ebc37d"],

