  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"c2c96eb8-dd1c-394f-9769-09def8a7b156"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14. Suggested Next Real Extensions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"9ab9018b-1fea-1c49-9016-daadf1128382"],

Cell["\<\
To make this even more physically complete, the next non-mock extensions \
would be: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6bccb73d-bb86-c943-9871-1f0e685c83c9"],

Cell["promote the reduced 1D model to a true 2D or 3D FEM PDE,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b7db80d1-500b-ff48-8e47-4d67b8e0df5d"],

Cell["\<\
define the Layer 0 sphere topology explicitly with a mesh/manifold \
representation,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f054d69c-332b-274e-b535-351ba66030b6"],

Cell["\<\
derive a genuine OPF tensor field action instead of the scalar reduced action,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4b2b7085-1473-6e4a-a043-991de6509885"],

Cell["\<\
compute full modal projections over a finite element eigenbasis,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"980db7f9-e72b-e549-8381-62b857c1a84e"],

Cell["\<\
add manufactured-solution verification and mesh convergence tests,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9ce04ad4-b25e-cd4d-abd7-172553bb43fc"],

Cell["add parameter inference for unresolved OPF constants.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"da66b18d-c8a9-df41-b30b-5992afff6209"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Useful testing infrastructure in the Wolfram stack includes ",
 ButtonBox["VerificationTest",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/VerificationTest"],
 ", ",
 ButtonBox["TestReport",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/TestReport"],
 ", and the PDE verification notebooks such as ",
 ButtonBox["Solid Mechanics Model Verification Tests",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->
   "paclet:PDEModels/tutorial/StructuralMechanics/\
SolidMechanicsVerificationTests"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a0cd57ac-50a8-8140-a83e-388ad9cacb75"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
